            </p>
</div>
<div class="clause-block" id="clause-p-2">
<p>
<span class="clause-num">0.2</span> <strong>You, the Client:</strong> — As Our Client and the subscriber, purchaser, or user of the Site or Services, this Agreement refers to You through any second-person pronouns, such as <em>"Your"</em> or <em>"Yours"</em>.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="statutory-callout">
<div class="statutory-header">
