<span class="clause-num">3.1</span> <strong>Term &amp; Auto-Renewal:</strong> The Initial Term commences upon confirmation of Your order. Upon expiration of the Initial Term, this Agreement automatically renews for successive renewal periods matching the selected billing frequency (monthly, quarterly, semi-annually, annually, or multi-year) at prevailing standard rates.
