            </p>
</div>
<div class="clause-block" id="clause-4-3">
<p>
<span class="clause-num">4.3</span> <strong>Truthful Contact Information:</strong> Providing false, fraudulent, or incomplete contact details, fake company names, or disposable numbers constitutes a material breach resulting in immediate account termination.
