</div>
<div class="clause-block" id="clause-4-4">
<p>
<span class="clause-num">4.4</span> <strong>Full Account Liability:</strong> Client is legally responsible for all actions and bandwidth transpiring under Client’s authenticated account credentials, whether authorized by Client or resulting from compromised client-side devices.
